// Seam parity: bridge only CONNECTED mesh boundaries; never glue detached limbs.
// Shared vertices are already geometrically welded in the HumanBody source.
// The narrow atlas-backed crossover hides different UV island colors without
// a generic skin-color cylinder or changing hitboxes / segment detachment.
