function duelSetupRootMenu(){window.DDNameSetupPending=false;window.DDPlayerNameDraft='';window.DDPlayerNameWasTyped=false;duelSetupConfirmed=false;document.documentElement.classList.remove('ddExportBoot');document.getElementById('ddExportLoading')?.style.setProperty('display','none');menu();if(typeof window.DDShowRootMenu==='function')window.DDShowRootMenu();}
const duelSetupUI=document.createElement('div');duelSetupUI.id='duelSetup';duelSetupUI.innerHTML=`<div class="duelSetupCard"><button type="button" class="duelRootMenuBtn" id="duelRootMenuBtn" aria-label="Return to Start and Settings menu">ROOT MENU</button><div class="duelSetupTopBar"><small>MERCY'S END · QUICK DRAW</small><nav class="duelSetupTopNav" aria-label="Game information"><button type="button" id="duelBindControlsBtn">BIND CONTROLS</button><button type="button" id="duelAboutBtn">ABOUT</button><button type="button" id="duelTop20Btn" disabled title="Leaderboard coming soon">TOP 20</button><button type="button" id="duelCreditsBtn">CREDITS</button></nav></div><h2>WHAT DO THEY CALL YOU?</h2><div class="ddNamePointerRow"><input id="duelPlayerInput" type="text" maxlength="30" value="" autocomplete="off" required aria-label="Gunslinger's name"/><button type="button" id="ddPointerToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ddPointerPanel" title="Choose in-game pointer" aria-label="Choose in-game pointer">+</button></div><div id="ddPointerPanel" class="ddPointerPanel" hidden><strong>POINTER · THIS DEVICE ONLY</strong><label><input type="radio" name="ddPointerKind" value="native"> MY OWN CURSOR</label><label><input type="radio" name="ddPointerKind" value="plus"> <span class="ddPointerSample">+</span> PLUS <input type="color" id="ddPointerPlusColor" value="#ff0000" title="Plus color" aria-label="Plus pointer color"></label><label><input type="radio" name="ddPointerKind" value="dot"> <span class="ddPointerSample">•</span> DOT <input type="color" id="ddPointerDotColor" value="#ff0000" title="Dot color" aria-label="Dot pointer color"></label><small>Only changes the displayed pointer; not recorded in lightweight Challenge JSON.</small></div><h3>CHOOSE YOUR REPUTATION</h3><div class="duelPaces">${Object.entries(DUEL_PACES).map(([id,p])=>`<label><input type="radio" name="duelPace" value="${id}" ${id==='trailhand'?'checked':''}/><span class="duelPaceHead"><b>${p.name}</b><span class="duelPaceTarget" data-pace-target="${id}">—</span></span><small>${p.caption}</small></label>`).join('')}</div><label class="ddSindenRow" for="ddGraphicsPreset">GRAPHICS <select id="ddGraphicsPreset" aria-label="Graphics quality" style="margin-left:9px;padding:7px 9px;background:#1a1713;color:#f4dcaa;border:1px solid #a27d50"><option value="performance">PERFORMANCE · slower laptops</option><option value="balanced">BALANCED · recommended</option><option value="quality">QUALITY · full detail</option></select><small>Render resolution, shadow quality and effects only · accurate aiming unchanged</small></label><label class="ddSindenRow"><input type="checkbox" id="duelSindenBorder"/>SINDEN BORDER <small>White frame · entire game view fits inside</small></label><div id="ddSindenThicknessSetting" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:6px 2px;color:#f0d6ac;font:12px Arial"><b>BORDER THICKNESS</b><button type="button" id="ddSindenThickMinus" aria-label="Decrease Sinden border thickness">−</button><input id="ddSindenBorderPx" aria-label="Sinden border thickness in pixels" type="number" min="2" max="120" step="2" value="40" style="width:56px;text-align:center;padding:4px;background:#111;color:#ffe6ae;border:1px solid #b89461"/><button type="button" id="ddSindenThickPlus" aria-label="Increase Sinden border thickness">+</button><small>px · 2–120 · default 40 · this device only</small></div><div id="ddSindenCountdownSetting" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:7px 0;color:#f0d6ac;font:12px Arial"><b>REF ENTRY COUNTDOWN · MOUSE / SINDEN</b><button type="button" id="ddSindenCountMinus" aria-label="Decrease Sinden countdown">−</button><input id="ddSindenCountSeconds" aria-label="Referee entry countdown seconds" type="number" min="0" max="60" step="1" value="10" style="width:46px;text-align:center;padding:4px;background:#111;color:#ffe6ae;border:1px solid #b89461"/><button type="button" id="ddSindenCountPlus" aria-label="Increase Sinden countdown">+</button><small>seconds · 0–60 · starts after cutscene or skip · aim locked in SAFE circle</small></div><div id="duelOfflineChallengeField" style="border-top:1px solid #886a45;margin-top:14px;padding-top:10px"><h3>OFFLINE GHOST CHALLENGE</h3><label for="duelOfflineChallengeFile" class="duelChallengeImportLabel">LOAD PLAYER 1 CHALLENGE JSON</label><input id="duelOfflineChallengeFile" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" style="display:block;max-width:100%;margin:9px 0;color:#f0d6ac"/><small id="duelOfflineChallengeStatus" aria-live="polite">No opponent challenge loaded · Normal singleplayer</small><button type="button" id="duelOfflineChallengeClear" style="display:none;margin-left:10px;padding:5px 9px">REMOVE GHOST</button></div><p>Keep your hand steady. The town is watching.</p><div class="duelSetupActions"><button type="button" id="duelSetupCancel">BACK</button><button type="button" id="duelSetupBegin">RIDE INTO TOWN</button></div></div><div id="duelAboutOverlay" class="duelAboutOverlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="duelAboutHeading" hidden><div class="duelAboutCard"><button type="button" id="duelAboutClose" aria-label="Close About" class="duelAboutX">✕</button><h2 id="duelAboutHeading">ABOUT · MERCY'S END</h2><p>A Western quick-draw game featuring nine challenges, a falling-leaf start signal, ghost duels, and six-shot revolvers.</p><h3>HOW DRAW TIMES WORK</h3><p>Game difficulty targets are <b>configured AI draw windows</b> averaged across stages—not measured human records. Stage 1–8 pace changes by reputation. Freestyle has no time limit.</p><p>Competitive player results use the game’s leaf-on-ground start signal and confirmed hit/kill events. They are not the same measurement as official fast-draw competitions, which use their own timed start and target rules.</p><h3>REAL FAST-DRAW RECORD HOLDERS · HISTORICAL REFERENCES</h3><ul><li><b>Ernie Hill</b> — Guinness fastest gun draw (open style), <b>0.208 seconds (208 ms)</b>, 1982. <a href="https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/86187-fastest-gun-draw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Guinness World Records</a></li><li><b>Ioan Nica (Nick Quick)</b> — WFDA traditional standing blanks, 4-inch target at 8 feet, index single shot, <b>0.236 seconds (236 ms)</b> on its published record list. <a href="https://www.fastdraw.org/wfda/wfd_records.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WFDA records</a></li><li><b>Nicole Franks</b> — WFDA women's traditional standing blanks, 4-inch target at 8 feet, index single shot, <b>0.267 seconds (267 ms)</b> on the same list. <a href="https://www.fastdraw.org/wfda/wfd_records.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WFDA records</a></li><li><b>Stampede (California)</b> — Cowboy Fast Draw Association men's 21-foot plate record, <b>0.283 seconds (283 ms)</b>, set October 3, 2026. <a href="https://cowboyfastdraw.com/hall-of-champions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CFDA Hall of Champions</a></li><li><b>K.K. Kid (Texas)</b> — Cowboy Fast Draw Association ladies' 21-foot plate record, <b>0.322 seconds (322 ms)</b>, set April 30, 2021. <a href="https://cowboyfastdraw.com/hall-of-champions/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CFDA Hall of Champions</a></li></ul><p class="duelAboutNote">These real-world names and records are listed for historical context and inspiration; they were <b>not</b> used as one-to-one values for Greenhorn, Trail Hand, Gunslinger, or Lightning Hand. Competition equipment, signals, distances, and hit criteria differ from this game.</p><div class="duelAboutFooter"><button type="button" id="duelAboutOkay">BACK TO GAME SETUP</button></div></div></div><div id="duelCreditsOverlay" class="duelAboutOverlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="duelCreditsHeading" hidden><div class="duelAboutCard"><button type="button" id="duelCreditsClose" aria-label="Close Credits" class="duelAboutX">✕</button><h2 id="duelCreditsHeading">CREDITS · MERCY'S END</h2><h3>GAME CREATION</h3><p><b>Game Created by:</b> Bladevampirek</p><h3>CONDEMNED COWBOY</h3><p><b>Condemned Cowboy:</b> Seph &amp; Bladevampirek</p><h3>PRODUCTION TOOLS &amp; AUDIO</h3><p>Revoicer pro was used, talkingphotos.ai lifetime subscription was used.</p><p>freesound.org sounds were edited &amp; used.</p><div class="duelAboutFooter"><button type="button" id="duelCreditsOkay">BACK TO GAME SETUP</button></div></div></div>`;
